WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.076 --> 00:00:06.848
"Detective Smith!" Roxy cried. "Are you okay?"

2
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.990
The detective sat up.

3
00:00:08.991 --> 00:00:13.045
Paint dripped from his face. "I'm fine."

4
00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:18.794
"Wait here," Roxy said. "I'll stop Kid Squid!"

5
00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:22.120
Roxy peeked through the door to the art gallery.

6
00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:24.557
The vandal stood in front of a wall.

7
00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:27.565
She wore a suit with several long arms.

8
00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:29.481
Paint sprayed from the arms.

9
00:00:29.482 --> 00:00:32.030
A big tank was strapped to her back.

10
00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:36.481
Roxy watched Kid Squid make an abstract painting on the gallery's wall.

11
00:00:36.482 --> 00:00:39.697
"Kid Squid is really good," Roxy thought.

12
00:00:39.698 --> 00:00:43.678
"But she shouldn't be painting there. I have to stop her!"

13
00:00:43.679 --> 00:00:47.390
Roxy zoomed into the gallery. "Stop right there!"

14
00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:49.590
Kid Squid spun around.

15
00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:56.260
"Rocket Girl! Are you here to admire my latest masterpiece?"

16
00:00:56.261 --> 00:01:00.348
"No," Roxy said. "I'm here to stop you."

17
00:01:00.349 --> 00:01:04.913
Kid Squid looked confused. "Why would you stop me?"

18
00:01:04.914 --> 00:01:07.856
"You're a vandal," Roxy said.

19
00:01:07.857 --> 00:01:12.825
Kid Squid gasped. "No, I'm an artist!"

20
00:01:12.826 --> 00:01:15.205
One of her arms shot paint toward Roxy.

21
00:01:15.206 --> 00:01:16.919
Roxy jumped out of the way.

22
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:20.459
Splat! The paint covered the gallery's window.

23
00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:24.879
"Ha!" Roxy said. "You can't hit me. I'm too—" Splat!

24
00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:29.869
A huge blob of thick paint hit Roxy in the face. She fell backward.

25
00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:33.388
"Grr!" Roxy jumped back to her feet.

26
00:01:33.389 --> 00:01:35.618
She wiped off the paint.

27
00:01:35.619 --> 00:01:38.189
Kid Squid was running out of the gallery.

28
00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:40.864
Roxy chased the vandal outside.

29
00:01:40.865 --> 00:01:48.334
Splat! Splat! Splat! Kid Squid fired paint in every direction.

30
00:01:48.335 --> 00:01:54.756
"Now everyone will see my beautiful artwork!" Kid Squid shouted.

31
00:01:54.757 --> 00:01:58.097
Across the street, painters were painting the side of a building.

32
00:01:58.098 --> 00:02:05.010
Splat! Splat! Blue paint splattered all over the red building.

33
00:02:05.011 --> 00:02:07.240
One painter threw down his brush.

34
00:02:07.241 --> 00:02:10.648
"Now we have to start all over!" Splat!

35
00:02:10.649 --> 00:02:13.335
Green paint splattered across the man.

36
00:02:13.336 --> 00:02:15.866
Roxy grabbed Kid Squid.

37
00:02:15.867 --> 00:02:18.744
"Let go!" the vandal shouted.

38
00:02:18.745 --> 00:02:20.930
Two of her other arms grabbed Roxy.

39
00:02:20.931 --> 00:02:23.122
She threw Roxy into the air.

40
00:02:23.123 --> 00:02:26.378
"Oof!" Roxy landed on the other side of the street.

41
00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:27.910
Paint flew toward her.

42
00:02:27.911 --> 00:02:29.741
Roxy rolled out of the way.

43
00:02:29.742 --> 00:02:34.978
She rushed toward Kid Squid. The vandal fired again.

44
00:02:34.979 --> 00:02:37.973
Whoosh! Roxy used her super breath.

45
00:02:37.974 --> 00:02:40.310
The paint flew back toward Kid Squid.

46
00:02:40.311 --> 00:02:44.394
The vandal ducked. The paint went all over the street.

47
00:02:44.395 --> 00:02:50.575
Cars and trucks slid in the wet paint.

48
00:02:50.576 --> 00:02:53.592
"Help!" a driver yelled.

49
00:02:53.593 --> 00:03:01.311
"Have fun saving everyone, Rocket Girl!" Kid Squid laughed.

50
00:03:01.312 --> 00:03:03.618
She ran and then slid across the paint.

51
00:03:03.619 --> 00:03:07.416
As she slid, she sprayed more paint in front of her.

52
00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:11.953
She zipped around the corner and was gone!

